OL,3,CThree young men killed in tragic
OL,4,Ccountry lane crash
OL,6,FTwo young men and a teenager have been
OL,7,Fkilled in a crash in Rotherham at the
OL,8,Fweekend.
OL,10,FAll three had been travelling along
OL,11,FDenaby Lane towards Kilnhurst late on
OL,12,FSaturday evening when the car they
OL,13,Fwere in left the carriageway and
OL,14,Fcrashed.
OL,16,FA 17-year-old boy and two men aged 21
OL,17,Fand 23 were in the Seat Cupra Leon at
OL,18,Fthe time and, despite the best efforts
OL,19,Fof paramedics, were pronounced dead at
OL,20,Fthe scene.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/2
